 Minimum of 2 years of experience in modelling and design tools, in IT consulting and in the production of studies in the field of requirement analysis, technical domain and quality; 
 Practical experience in the design of XML Schemas, XML, XSLT, SOA based data analysis, BPMN, SQL, Oracle, UML etc; 
