 Ependys GmbH (Germany) is launching a Berlin-based start up that aspires to provide world-class services related to e-retail supply chain. We are targeting international market opportunities, and have secured pre-seed funding to carry out the proof of concept. For the immediately pending phases of our evolution, we are looking for an entrepreneurial CTO to kick-start development and implementation of IT capability. The CTO will be based out from Athens, Greece, and his/her role may be either a pure CTO role, or a combined CTO-and-developer role (i.e. including code writing). 
 RESPONSIBILITIES 
 Identify key industry and technology trends to build, manage and scale up the start-up’s technology vision, software, and technology operations - incl. input in company’s strategy development and execution. 
